    },
    "_string": "Free Spins can be obtained throughactivities, promotions, etc.\n\nFree Spins will expire seven days after being acquired.\n\nOnce Free Spins expires or is discarded, it will permanently disappear， equivalent to the player giving up the bonus.\n\nDuring Free Spins, you can choose topause its use, the remaining spins will be retained, and players can choose “Continue” on the page to re-enable it.\n\nPlayers can have multiple Free Spins at the same time, but only one Free Spins can be activated at a time. You must complete or discard the previous FreeSpins before triggering the next Free Spins.\n\nFor Free Spins of other games, please go to the specified game.\n\nIn case of special circumstances, SpinMaster reserves the right to modify, change, or suspend, and has the final interpretation.",
